1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,800
I still hope it's you and me in the end. My heart cannot imagine a world without you.

2
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:13,080
No matter how many years pass without us seeing each other, or how much distance stands between us,

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:20,520
even if the universe itself tries to keep us apart, I will always find my way back to you.
